# UX workflow: open sequencer quick controls, change selection/value, and apply.
# Purpose: validates held-button modal routing, quick-control selection, OPT
# editing, and release-to-apply semantics.

0 scenario sequencer
50 capture screen sequencer_ready

# Hold LEFT_CENTER to enter quick controls.
150 button LEFT_CENTER down
300 capture screen quick_controls_open

# Navigate a quick-control row and change its value.
400 encoder NAV 1
500 encoder OPT 0.70
650 capture screen quick_controls_adjusted

# Release LEFT_CENTER to apply and close.
750 button LEFT_CENTER up
950 capture screen quick_controls_closed
